<title>UK: London gold fixes easier, nothing further from BuB.</title>
<headline>London gold fixes easier, nothing further from BuB.</headline>
<text>
<p>GOLD - Fixed at $346.40 vs $348.10 earlier. Edged lower after Bundesbank Council meeting ends without further statement on plans for gold reserves. Dollar off floor.</p>
<p>SILVER - Largely ignored at $4.83/$4.85, down two cents.</p>
<p>PLATINUM - Off $3.10 at $392.45/$393.45.</p>
<p>PALLADIUM - Down $3.25 at $171.75/$172.75. Volatile.</p>
</text>
